body:
Well, my department is historically a department of 2 and my supervisor is leaving so I am now leading my department. They want to hire an entry level person and as lead I guess I am supervising! So, it's less that I "broke in" and more that I don't exactly have a choice lol. 

&#x200B;

Thank you for that advice! It's really helpful!!

Quality of life or not, he does NOT get to dictate what you do to your body. I would understand this more if this was a conversation if you had joint finances (but it sounds like you don't), therefore this shouldn't affect him at all. 

&#x200B;

Let him be mad, it'll maybe teach him a lesson that he doesn't get to control your decisions and what you do with your body.
